{
  "id": "shu-independent",
  "title": {
    "ja": "Shu–Osher：独立参照と格子収束",
    "en": "Shu–Osher: independent reference and mesh refinement"
  },
  "method_ids": [
    "muscl"
  ],
  "summary": {
    "ja": "衝撃波と密度正弦波の相互作用を、同じPython実装の細格子ではなく、別に実行したAthena++の参照と照合します。",
    "en": "Compare shock–density-wave interaction against separately executed Athena++ reference data rather than a finer grid of the same Python code."
  },
  "assumptions": {
    "ja": "γ=1.4、[-5,5]、t=1.8。x<-4は(rho,u,p)=(3.857143,2.629369,10.33333)、右はrho=1+0.2sin5x,u=0,p=1。",
    "en": "gamma=1.4, [-5,5], t=1.8. For x<-4, (rho,u,p)=(3.857143,2.629369,10.33333); to the right rho=1+0.2sin5x,u=0,p=1."
  },
  "algorithm": {
    "ja": "アトラス側はMC-MUSCL/HLLC/SSPRK3、Athena++側はPLM/HLLC/RK3。公式problem generatorの位置と正弦波の波数だけを合わせるpatchを保存し、solver本体は変更しません。",
    "en": "Atlas uses MC-MUSCL/HLLC/SSPRK3; Athena++ uses PLM/HLLC/RK3. A saved problem-generator patch matches only shock location and sinusoid wavenumber; the independent solver is unchanged."
  },
  "validation": {
    "ja": "100/200/400セルの密度L1誤差と改善率、正値性を測り、参照2048/4096/8192セルの差も事前幅と比較します。境界へ衝撃波が届かない固定時刻で比較します。",
    "en": "Measure density L1 error, refinement and positivity on 100/200/400 cells; also compare 2048/4096/8192 reference differences with a predeclared bound. The shock has not reached the boundaries at the fixed comparison time."
  },
  "limits": {
    "ja": "参照は厳密解ではなく独立した有限格子数値解です。異なる流束系列すべての優劣、WENOの一般的高次数、負圧防止の保証には広げません。 参照2048→4096のL1差0.005346は事前幅0.005を満たさず、8192へ細分しました。途中の未達記録も残します。",
    "en": "The reference is an independent finite-grid numerical solution, not an exact solution. No universal flux ranking, WENO-order claim or positivity guarantee is inferred. The 2048-to-4096 reference L1 increment0.005346 missed the predeclared0.005 bound, so8192 cells were added. The earlier miss remains recorded."
  },
